1	line	Sack	Mumblemumble. Mumblemumblemumble.
1	line	Odd Old Man	I'm collecting bones for the museum.
1	line	Odd Old Man	They have asked me to rig up some displays of second and third age creatures using their bones, so that people can come and...well, look at them.
1	line	Odd Old Man	I need to get them into some sort of order before I begin, but I've run into a bit of a snag.
1	line	Player	What sort of a snag?
1	line	Odd Old Man	Well, I need to have all the bones I'm going to use here, and placed into some sort of order.
1	line	Odd Old Man	However, I seem to have discovered I am a few short.
